--- m2: $basetexture2 is never read (the terrain stops being a blend material)
  MUTATION-CAUGHT=PASS (m2: declared=0 while the shader still reads WorldVertexTransition)
--- m3: every uploaded weight is forced to 1 (the blend draws the second layer flat)
  MUTATION-CAUGHT=PASS (m3: distinctWeights=1 weightMin=1 while weightedVertices=33900)
--- m4: the blend-modulate flag never reaches a vertex (hard edges)
